## 4) Relayer ABI & submit function update (`relayer/index.js`)

Update the ABI to include the new `bool` parameter and send the reimburseInETH flag when calling.

```js
const routerAbi = [
  'function sponsorWithFlashLoan(address asset,uint256 amount,address relayerAddress,address userTarget,bytes userCallData,uint256 reimburseAmount,bool reimburseInETH)'
];

// then when submitting
const tx = await router.sponsorWithFlashLoan(asset, amount, relayerAddress, userTarget, userCallData, reimburseAmount, reimburseInETH, { gasLimit });
```

Also update the `relayer/server.js` handler to accept an optional `intent.reimburseInETH` boolean (default false), compute reimbursement, and pass it through to `submitSponsoredTx`.

