## 6) Relayer server handler changes (snippet)

In `relayer/server.js` update the verification and handler to accept `intent.reimburseInETH` and pass it to the submit function. Key parts:

```js
const reimburseInETH = !!intent.reimburseInETH;

const receipt = await submitSponsoredTx({
  asset: intent.asset,
  amount: intent.amount,
  relayerAddress: process.env.RELAYER_ADDRESS,
  userTarget: intent.userTarget,
  userCallData: intent.userCallDataHex,
  reimburseAmount: reimburse.toString(),
  reimburseInETH
});
```

And update `submitSponsoredTx` signature in `relayer/index.js` to accept `reimburseInETH` and forward it to the contract call.

